SUMMARY:Vitalant Blood Drive
DESCRIPTION:Scary Good Giveaway!  No tricks\, just treats.\n\nDonate in 
 Oct. to help patients who rely on blood donations and you’ll be entered 
 to win one of two $10\,000 gift cards.*\n\nSchedule your appointment today. 
 Make an appointment at vitalant.org & use zip code: 07003 or call 
 877-25-VITAL\n\nBLOOMFIELD LIBRARY BLOOD DRIVE ON BLOODBMOBILE\n\n90 Broad 
 Street Bloomfield\, NJ 07003\n\nFriday\, October 30\, 2026\n\n11:00 a.m. to 
 2:15 p.m
LOCATION:Bloomfield - Theater\, Bloomfield Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Bloomfield Library":MAILTO:reference@bloomfield.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Special Event
UID:LibCal-10270-17638627
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17638627
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20261031T133000Z
DTEND:20261031T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20261031T000000Z
SUMMARY:Halloween Movie Marathon & Trick-or-Treating in the Library!
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a SPOOKY movie marathon this Halloween! \n\n9:30AM 
 - 10AM: It's The Great Pumpkin\, Charlie Brown! (Rated G)\n\n10AM - 12PM: 
 Coco (Rated PG)\n\n12PM - 1:30PM: The Nightmare Before Christmas (Rated 
 PG)\n\n2:30PM - 3PM: Hotel Transylvania (Rated PG) \n\nWe will also be 
 having Trick-or-Treating until 2pm (while supplies last)! It's going to be 
 a real GHOUL time! Hope to see you there 👻🎃
LOCATION:Bloomfield - Theater\, Bloomfield Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Bloomfield Library":MAILTO:reference@bloomfield.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Movie
UID:LibCal-10270-17773679
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17773679
END:VEVENT
