SUMMARY:Cookie Decorating Class
DESCRIPTION:Love sugar cookies?\n\nDon’t miss this fun\, hands-on 
 decorating class with Steph’s Baking Boutique! Learn sweet techniques\, 
 get creative with icing\, and take home your own delicious masterpieces! 
 Each group will be given 3 cookies to decorate together.\n\nRegistration is 
 required. One registration per group.
LOCATION:Bloomfield Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Bloomfield Library":MAILTO:reference@bloomfield.bccls.org
